{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33762","headline":"正乐府十篇 哀陇民 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 哀陇民","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇山千万仞，鹦鹉巢其巅。\n穷危又极嶮，其山犹不全。\n蚩蚩陇之民，悬度如登天。\n空中觇其巢，堕者争纷然。\n百禽不得一，十人九死焉。\n陇川有戍卒，戍卒亦不闲。\n将命提雕笼，直到金台前。\n彼毛不自珍，彼舌不自言。\n胡爲轻人命，奉此玩好端。\n吾闻古圣王，珍兽皆舍旃。\n今此陇民属，每岁啼涟涟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}